ng":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":false,"date":"16 Sep, 2024"},"required_age":0,"reviews":"\u201c\u201cAfter watching the trailer for this on Steam, I thought it was going to be a fairly vanilla platformer game, but with a cool visual style. The visual style is, in fact, very cool. But the gameplay is so much more than I was expecting. It's almost more of a puzzle game than a platformer. Each screen is more about figuring out how to progress and how to utilize your toolset than it is about combat or precision platforming. Though there are hints of those things as well. I really liked this demo and am now super excited to play this game when it's released. I recommend checking it out!\u201d\u201d<br>MrJehoe<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197570/ss_784736edcb073d3c47b5d293e6826beedcf93908.1920x1080.jpg?t=1745147223","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197570/ss_784736edcb073d3c47b5d293e6826beedcf93908.600x338.jpg?t=1745147223"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197570/ss_3656715000d5d194e2cad9786efaea97934e5d45.1920x1080.jpg?t=1745147223","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197570/ss_3656715000d5d194e2cad9786efaea97934e5d45.600x338.jpg?t=1745147223"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197570/ss_a5b13e8cc77a359634c92b1e444cd193492ec740.1920x1080.jpg?t=1745147223","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197570/ss_a5b13e8cc77a359634c92b1e444cd193492ec740.600x338.jpg?t=1745147223"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197570/ss_486d29171847b05eb514c237315d658b1997d0fc.1920x1080.jpg?t=1745147223","path_thumbnail":"https://share